  "limits": "All twelve original source slices and all 216 actual techniques inspected; original battle raw captures were not inspected. V1 and V2 rejected with 430 and 89 geometry warnings respectively. Only one raw body slice from each rejected candidate was inspected; their technique captures exist but were not inspected. V3 all twelve source raw slices and all 216 actual technique frames inspected and passed. Final twenty-four raw source/battle slices, thirty-two low/medium production transition slices, twenty-four advancing idle frames, all 216 fresh actual technique frames and sixteen atlas cells separately inspected and pass. Runtime camera used frozen complete-face bounds before the first final runtime capture. The entire original 27-joint hierarchy, inverse binds, sculpt, UVs/textures and 224 unrelated curves including all wing curves are conserved. Old leg influences on adjacent body/feather surfaces are rebound continuously; original wing weights are not claimed unchanged. Limb-mask centers and joint arrays in the limb recipe use a fixed normalized anatomical frame scaled to half-extent .95; the module transforms target joints into actual world space using the original box. The neck report lists two potential tracks per clip; eighteen actual finite retargeted curves are tested. The face-stage recipe remains an unapproved intermediate, and only the combined four-stage V3 final is approved here. No authenticated live account modal replay claimed.",
